  "notable_quotes": [
    "More sophisticated all-atom/flexible-framework models give diffusion coefficients up to an order of magnitude lower and in much closer agreement with experiment.",
    "The united-atom approximation has severe limitations here: it smooths the potential, lowers diffusion barriers, and underrepresents chain-wall intermolecular interactions.",
    "For n-C8 to n-C20 in silicalite at 300 K, rigid-framework simulations show a periodic chain-length dependence of diffusion in the [010] direction, consistent with resonant diffusion."
  ],
